[116.678578, "o", "19:class Sink(ABC, Generic[X]):  # noqa: B024\r\n22:    Base class for all output sinks. Do not subclass this.\r\n24:    If you want to implement a custom connector, instead subclass one\r\n32:class StatefulSinkPartition(ABC, Generic[X, S]):\r\n42:        See {py:obj}`FixedPartitionedSink.part_fn` for how the key is\r\n56:        of {py:obj}`FixedPartitionedSink.build_part`.\r\n80:class FixedPartitionedSink(Sink[Tuple[str, X]], Generic[X, S]):\r\n161:class StatelessSinkPartition(ABC, Generic[X]):"]
