[146.310151, "o", "297:def inspect_debug(\r\n498:def redistribute(step_id: str, up: Stream[X]) -> Stream[X]:\r\n501:    The `{py:obj}~bytewax.operators.redistribute` operator is\r\n516:    Use cases for `redistribute`:\r\n525:    `redistribute` only helps increase utilization when placed immediately before\r\n544:    flow = Dataflow(\"redistribute_eg\")\r\n547:    redistributed = op.redistribute(\"redistribute\", nums)\r\n549:    op.inspect_debug(\"out\", redistributed)\r\n561:    assuming your file is named `redistribute_eg.py`\r\n564:    python -m bytewax.run redistribute:flow\r\n"]
